  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution to OECD Development Assistance Committee (DAC) Programme of Work and Budget (PWB) 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2025-2026 Programme of Work and Budget (PWB) for OECD DAC has four objectives:
1)	Enabling shared prosperity through better sustainable policies in development co-operation to leave no one behind;
2)	Incentivising increased and better aligned financing for sustainable development;
3)	More effective and impactful use of development resources through evidence, reviews, learning and reforms;
4)	Enhancing global engagement, dialogues and partnerships for improved global co-operation and trust-building.</narrative>
  </description>
